{"fw":"hozu","step":21,"tools":2,"commit":"9d1135a","attempts":1,"timedOut":false,"accept":{"passed":67,"total":67,"new":{"passed":3,"total":3},"regression":{"passed":64,"total":64},"failures":[]},"introduced":[],"introducedBase":null,"silentReview":false,"silentHint":false,"admitsProblem":false,"final":"--js both`，有開和關 JavaScript 兩種模式都跑過：\n  - 種子資料的編號和需求表一致。\n  - 刪除 `Buy milk` 後按 `Undo`，它仍是 No. 2；封存再還原，編號也沒變。\n  - 刪除 `Buy milk` 後新增 `Milk2`，拿到的是 No. 3，沒有重用 2。\n  - bob 新增筆記拿到 No. 2，不受 ada 影響。\n  - 刪除 ada 的帳號後用同一個名字重新登入，新增的筆記從 No. 1 開始。\n- **啟動：** `PORT=4831 npm start` 啟動後在 4831 回應 200，伺服器已用 PID 關掉。\n\n## 要注意的地方\n- 我沒找到不能用的功能。\n- 目前所有資料都放在記憶體裡（原本就是這樣），所以伺服器重啟後筆記和編號都會回到種子資料。正在使用的環境更新上線時，現有的筆記本來就會因重啟而消失，這次修改沒有改變這一點。\n\n## 下一步建議\n1. **持久化儲存：** 如果之後要接資料庫，計數器要和新增筆記放在同一個交易裡，避免同時新增時拿到重複編號。\n2. **補自動化測試：** 用 `@hozu/testing` 為「編號不重用」和「刪除帳號後從 1 開始」寫回歸測試。\n3. **檢查其他頁面：** 確認封存頁和匯出（`/api/export`）要不要也顯示編號；這次需求只要求列表頁，所以我沒有改。","cost":{"weighted":116457,"calls":15,"output":4658,"fresh":44095,"cached":490721,"turnsBy":{"edit":1,"scaffold":0,"check":0,"verify":5,"serve":1,"docs":4,"spec":0,"read":3,"list":0,"other":0,"final":1},"carriedBy":{"edit":2903,"scaffold":0,"check":0,"verify":5583,"serve":410,"docs":18885,"spec":0,"read":23630,"list":0,"other":0,"start":41777},"fixes":0,"verifyOrServe":6,"toolsBy":{"edit":1,"scaffold":0,"check":0,"verify":5,"serve":1,"docs":4,"spec":1,"read":3,"list":0,"other":0}},"size":{"lines":1475,"added":20,"removed":7},"duplication":{"lines":1080,"duplicatedLines":82,"ratio":0.0759,"blocks":9},"js":{"login":22531,"list":23216},"hozu":{"checkOk":true,"typesOk":true,"errors":0,"warnings":0,"codes":[],"deadStates":0,"contracts":{"covered":6,"total":6},"lockEntries":72,"lockChanged":0,"states":16,"transitions":72,"diagnosticsSeen":{},"hz018":{"count":0,"blocking":0,"warnings":0,"identical":0,"distinct":0,"runs":0},"hz057":{"count":0,"blocking":0,"warnings":0,"identical":0,"distinct":0,"runs":0},"lock":{"committed":72,"computed":72,"uncommittedNew":0,"uncommitt